### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Read a book",
  "description": "At least 5 pages",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-25"
}

### Get a specific task (change the ID after you create one)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1

### Update a task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Read a book (updated)",
  "description": "At least 10 pages now",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-25"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1

### Test 404 - should return your custom error message
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/999